<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Exposes min and max functions for 3 to 4 scalar parameters.</para>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_scalar__common_8hpp">glm/ext/scalar_common.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>

